<div class="container py-5">
  <div class="row">
    <div class="col-lg-10 mx-auto">
      <div class="card shadow-sm">
        <div class="card-body p-5">
          <h1 class="display-6 fw-bold mb-4">Document and ID Protection Policy</h1>
          <p class="lead mb-4">Last Updated: <%= typeof lastUpdatedDate !== 'undefined' ? lastUpdatedDate : '12 Apr 2026' %></p>

          <div class="mb-4">
            <h2 class="h4 fw-bold">1. Why We Collect Documents</h2>
            <p>We collect identity documents and ID numbers only for applicant verification, fraud prevention, and safety checks related to account approval on Rapira.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="mb-4">
            <h2 class="h4 fw-bold">2. What We Collect</h2>
            <ul>
              <li>identity proof image uploaded by applicant</li>
              <li>ID number submitted in the form (for example PAN, where applicable)</li>
              <li>basic profile and contact details required for application processing</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="mb-4">
            <h2 class="h4 fw-bold">3. No Sharing With Other Platforms</h2>
            <p>We do not sell, rent, or share your uploaded documents or ID numbers with other platforms for marketing or commercial use.</p>
            <p>Data may be shared only with trusted service providers who process data on our behalf under confidentiality obligations, or when legally required by law enforcement, courts, or regulators.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="mb-4">
            <h2 class="h4 fw-bold">4. Access Control and Security</h2>
            <ul>
              <li>access is restricted to authorized team members who process applications</li>
              <li>documents are stored using secured infrastructure and controlled access</li>
              <li>we apply reasonable technical and organizational safeguards to prevent unauthorized access, misuse, or disclosure</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="mb-4">
            <h2 class="h4 fw-bold">5. Retention and Deletion</h2>
            <p>We retain documents and ID data only as long as needed for verification, legal compliance, dispute handling, and platform security.</p>
            <p>After the retention period or when no longer required, data is deleted or anonymized, subject to legal requirements.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="mb-4">
            <h2 class="h4 fw-bold">6. Your Responsibilities</h2>
            <ul>
              <li>upload only your own valid documents</li>
              <li>do not upload unrelated or third-party documents</li>
              <li>ensure information submitted is accurate and up to date</li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <div class="mb-4">
            <h2 class="h4 fw-bold">7. Your Rights</h2>
            <p>Subject to applicable law, you may request access, correction, or deletion of your personal data by contacting us through the contact page.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="mb-4">
            <h2 class="h4 fw-bold">8. Policy Updates</h2>
            <p>We may update this policy from time to time. Updated versions will be posted on this page with a revised "Last Updated" date.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="alert alert-light border mt-4">
            <strong>Contact:</strong> For questions regarding document privacy and identity verification, please use our <a href="/contact">Contact</a> page.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
